  /*
   {"diagramJson":"{\"title\":\"01_profile_erewhon_customer_origins_with_placepulse_embeddings\",\"description\":\"Maps the PlacePulse embeddings of Los Angeles, scores how unusual each H3 cell is, and clusters the cells that send visitors to Erewhon stores.\",\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"82938e4d-599d-4d2d-a33d-60aeb7bf8fda\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#E5E5E5\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":368,\"height\":368,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Overview\\n---\\n## Profile Erewhon customer origins with PlacePulse embeddings\\nThis workflow uses PlacePulse embeddings for Los Angeles at H3 resolution 7. An embedding is a numeric vector that describes the structural character (sociodemographics, business, climate...) of one H3 cell.\\n\\n- **Top branch:** maps the embeddings and measures how unusual each cell is.\\n- **Bottom branch:** groups the cells that send visitors to Erewhon stores into clusters.\",\"position\":{\"x\":112,\"y\":-176}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":576,\"height\":272,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":112,\"y\":112},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":208,\"y\":-240}},{\"id\":\"b4cfb99d-7ec1-4d36-86b1-23a9d77cc292\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#F6CF71\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":320,\"height\":448,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Data\\n---\\n## PlacePulse embeddings\\nOne row per H3 cell in Los Angeles. `GEOID` is the H3 index. The `emb_*` columns are the embedding dimensions.\",\"position\":{\"x\":496,\"y\":-112}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":320,\"height\":176,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":496,\"y\":-112},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":208,\"y\":176}},{\"id\":\"e36fe05d-aadc-42f1-8032-125ab2c8aee3\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#F6CF71\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":320,\"height\":368,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Data\\n---\\n## Erewhon visits\\nVisits from each H3 cell (`h7`) to each of the 13 Erewhon stores (`store_name`, `visits`).\",\"position\":{\"x\":496,\"y\":352}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":320,\"height\":176,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":496,\"y\":352},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":208,\"y\":432}},{\"id\":\"f7d30bde-f94b-4522-bbca-042a7fe38f81\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#9EB9F3\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":624,\"height\":448,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Spatial profiles\\n---\\n## Describe the spatial profile  of LA\\n1. **Visualization** reduces the embeddings to three PCA components and maps them to RGB. Similar colours mean similar cells.\\n2. **Mean Deviation** scores how far each cell is from the mean embedding of LA.\\n3. **Neighbourhood Deviation** compares each cell with its first ring of neighbours. High values mark boundaries between different areas. \",\"position\":{\"x\":832,\"y\":-112}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":480,\"height\":320,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":832,\"y\":-112},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":864,\"y\":-240}},{\"id\":\"56489563-6eea-4b7d-ac28-636ce26b649f\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"Note\",\"color\":\"#8BE0A4\",\"genAi\":false,\"label\":\"\",\"width\":624,\"height\":368,\"inputs\":[],\"markdown\":\"---\\nlabel: Clustering\\n---\\n## Cluster the Erewhon origin cells\\n1. **Join** keeps only the cells that send visitors to a store and attaches their embeddings.\\n2. **Drop Columns** and **Remove Duplicated** remove the store and visit fields, so each cell appears once.\\n3. **Clustering** runs K-means with k = 5 on the embeddings to group cells with a similar structural profile.\",\"position\":{\"x\":832,\"y\":352}},\"type\":\"note\",\"width\":544,\"height\":256,\"zIndex\":-1,\"dragging\":false,\"position\":{\"x\":832,\"y\":352},\"selected\":false,\"positionAbsolute\":{\"x\":864,\"y\":624}},{\"id\":\"98dcc9dd-1f85-4eed-b00f-ef84dcdca3f5\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"native.joinv2\",\"type\":\"generic\",\"label\":\"Join\",\"inputs\":[{\"name\":\"lefttable\",\"type\":\"Table\",\"title\":\"Left table\",\"description\":\"Left table\"},{\"name\":\"righttable\",\"type\":\"Table\",\"title\":\"Right table\",\"description\":\"Right table\"},{\"name\":\"lefttablekeycolumn\",\"type\":\"Column\",\"title\":\"Key column in left table\",\"parent\":\"lefttable\",\"dataType\":[\"boolean\",\"date\",\"datetime\",\"time\",\"timestamp\",\"number\",\"string\"],\"description\":\"Key column in left table\",\"value\":\"h7\"},{\"name\":\"lefttablecolumns\",\"type\":\"ColumnsForJoin\",\"title\":\"Left table columns\",\"parent\":\"lefttable\",\"optional\":true,\"description\":\"Left table columns\",\"value\":\"[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"store_name\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"store_name\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"visits\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"visits\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"h7\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"h7\\\"}]\"},{\"name\":\"righttablekeycolumn\",\"type\":\"Column\",\"title\":\"Key column in right table\",\"parent\":\"righttable\",\"dataType\":[\"boolean\",\"date\",\"datetime\",\"time\",\"timestamp\",\"number\",\"string\"],\"description\":\"Key column in right table\",\"value\":\"GEOID\"},{\"name\":\"righttablecolumns\",\"type\":\"ColumnsForJoin\",\"title\":\"Right table columns\",\"parent\":\"righttable\",\"optional\":true,\"description\":\"Right table columns\",\"value\":\"[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_0\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_0\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_1\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_1\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_2\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_2\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_3\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_3\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_4\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_4\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_5\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_5\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_6\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_6\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_7\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_7\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_8\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_8\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_9\\\",\\\"joinname\\\":\\\"emb_9\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"emb_10\\\",\\\"joinname\\\